# The objects themselves are committed when they exist (see README.md);
# nothing else in these directories is.
#
# Two rules above would otherwise exclude them: `*.o` at the repository root,
# and `rt_file.bpf.o` in this module's own .gitignore, which is there to keep
# the standalone Makefile's build output untracked. Neither excludes a parent
# DIRECTORY, so re-including the files here works.
!rt_file.bpf.o
!*/rt_file.bpf.o
